# Security and tenancy

- Every financial query/mutation must filter by authorized `household_id`.
- Never trust client-supplied household id without membership check.
- Authorize on the server. UI hiding is not security.
- Passwords: Argon2id. Sessions: HTTP-only cookies. No secrets in the frontend.
- Validate all inputs. Rate-limit auth. Audit money, rules, members, export, delete.
- Roles: owner, partner, member, viewer (advisor later).
- Do not log secrets or full account numbers.
